        "body": "## Context\nUnder P10 an owner-authored PR has no eligible owner approver. A second account that never pushes and is not an agent is the expected approver (ADR-16).\n\n## Steps\n- [ ] Create the account; enable 2FA\n- [ ] Grant review rights on consumer repos; no push rights\n- [ ] Record its numeric user id for `.assay/owners` `approvers`\n\n## Done when\n- Account exists and its numeric id is recorded\n\n## Blocked by\n_Nothing; can start now._",
